omnicom (1.5-1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Reorganize Serial tab layout: Type and Port fields side-by-side
  * Update Quick target presets button style and add SSH profiles integration
  * Add packets count field for ICMP (MTR) traceroute method
  * Add common ports quick presets to IP scan and traceroute
  * Add RDP (3389) and VNC (5900) to default scan ports
  * Add proxy configuration (SOCKS/HTTP) to traceroute
  * Auto-display latency graph when MTR finishes
  * Move DNS Lookup checkbox to Target row
  * Improve read-only filesystem handling for traceroute capabilities
  * Optimize field layouts and widths for better content visibility
  * Fix MTR fields visibility on initial load
  * Add WiFi Site Survey with network scanning and channel usage chart
  * Add WiFi channel chart with Gaussian curves, BSSID grouping and animation
  * Refactor WiFi survey from BSSID to SSID grouping with Both-band support
  * Add Power Analysis graph (SignalHistoryWidget) with scrolling time-series
  * Add signal loss detection with persistent red markers on Power Analysis graph
  * Add segmented curve drawing to avoid lines across loss regions
  * Add adjustable time window slider for Power Analysis X-axis
  * Add audio feedback for Power Analysis: pitched double-beep per scan cycle
  * Add repeating harsh alarm tone while signal is absent (repeats every 4 s)
  * Add audio enable/disable checkbox in Power Analysis controls
  * Translate all UI strings to English

